@startuml
title E Visa Processing And Follow Up System - State Diagram

[*] --> AccountCreated

state "Account Created" as AccountCreated
state "Logged In" as LoggedIn
state "Application Pending" as ApplicationPending
state "Viewed Status" as ViewedStatus
state "Cancelled Application" as CancelledApplication
state "Modified Details" as ModifiedDetails
state "Viewed Details" as ViewedDetails
state "Check Status" as CheckStatus
state "Feedback Given" as FeedbackGiven
state "Logged Out" as LoggedOut

AccountCreated --> LoggedIn : Login

LoggedIn --> ApplicationPending : Apply For Visa, Make Payment, Accept Application
ApplicationPending --> ViewedStatus : View Status
ViewedStatus --> CheckStatus : Check Status
CheckStatus --> ViewedStatus : View Again
CheckStatus --> FeedbackGiven : Give Feedback
FeedbackGiven --> ViewedDetails : View Details
ViewedDetails --> ModifiedDetails : Modify Details
ModifiedDetails --> LoggedOut : Logout

ApplicationPending --> CancelledApplication : Cancel Application

LoggedIn --> ViewedDetails : View Details

@enduml
